    {
      "id": "dom-2994575f",
      "text": "Windows 保存源码与 Git；Debian WSL2 用于可重建的 Linux 构建和测试。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p.doc-lead:nth-of-type(2)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-dbdb5387",
      "text": "工作区",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-1",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-1c376aa3",
      "text": "管理端和公开页属于同一 pnpm workspace。Hub 与 Agent 分别位于 server/ 和 agent/；生产文档位于 docs/。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-dff6ac96",
      "text": "本地验证",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-2",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-ed47217a",
      "text": "Linux 构建通过 linux-task.ps1 的 build 模式运行。按改动范围执行前端、Rust、脚本和浏览器测试；完整 Linux 门禁入口为 make check-linux。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(4)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-6a0ef1da",
      "text": "提交与交付",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-3",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-301a9320",
      "text": "使用有明确目的的 Conventional Commits。发布和远端操作遵循单独的发布流程，测试结果必须对应实际提交和工件。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(5)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
